From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:06:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: brcmutil: expose the common module in Kconfig

Give BRCMUTIL a visible tristate prompt so OpenWrt can select the shared
Broadcom helpers independently.

Original author was not recorded in the imported patch.
[viking.yfy@qq.com: complete imported patch metadata]
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/Kconfig
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/broadcom/brcm80211/Kconfig
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 # SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-only
 config BRCMUTIL
-	tristate
+	tristate "Broadcom 802.11 driver utility functions"
 	depends on m
 
 config BRCMSMAC
